/// The generated file implements the BlockDef trait with stub infer_shape,
/// param_count, and codegen functions for all 3 targets (pytorch, keras, candle).
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `block_name` - The PascalCase block type name (e.g., "MyCustomLayer")
